  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> be two events such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math> stands for the complement of the event&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>.&nbsp;Then the events&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Independent but not equally likely.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
