      "text": "Independent and equally likely.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Mutually exclusive and independent.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Equally likely but not independent.",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are independent and since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math> they are not equally likely.</p>"
